'''Kyoko Sakura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 292
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Kyoko Sakura
|name2 = Kyoko & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kyoko & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kyoko Sakura is, in essence, [[Homura Akemi (Uber Rare Cat)|Homura Akemi]] with the only real things that separate them being typing, range and attack rate. Overall, this unit has solid stats and can be a nice generalist, but her long time between attacks can sometimes become a problem.

With that being said, it is recommended you use Kyoko purely for damage, as her niche of Knocking back and Weakening Red Enemies is already done better by two more spammable Rare Cats: [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Dread Pirate Catley]] and [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]]. Therefore, whenever she creates these effects in battle, treat them as a bonus, as there are more accessible units typically doing her anti-red job much better.

Since she is immune to weaken and has Witch Killer, she could also be used against enemies like [[Nutcracker Witch (Enemy)|Nutcracker Witch]] when the collab is around.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

